Oriel Chromium patch 0011: a renderer launched with --no-zygote skips the zygote.

On Linux every renderer is forked from the generic zygote, which has the
sandbox engaged, whatever the renderer's own command line says
(RendererSandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate::GetZygote). So a renderer that
CEF patch 0010's OnBeforeRenderProcessLaunch gives --no-sandbox for an
unsandboxed session would still run sandboxed. RenderProcessHostImpl::Init
now tells the delegate to skip the zygote when the renderer's command line has
--no-zygote, and the renderer is launched directly, as Electron's
support_mixed_sandbox_with_zygote.patch does. Renderers without the switch
are untouched. Does nothing off USE_ZYGOTE builds. No CEF API change.

Resolves: Oriel docs/DRIFT.md W13 on Linux (with 0010).
Base: Chromium 154.0.8037.94 with CEF a03e714's patches. Applies in chromium/src.
diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
index 0d96ded..48963a7 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
@@ -2097,6 +2097,12 @@ bool RenderProcessHostImpl::Init() {
     std::unique_ptr<SandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate> sandbox_delegate =
         std::make_unique<RendererSandboxedProcessLauncherDelegateWin>(
             *cmd_line, IsPdf(), IsJitDisabled());
+#elif BUILDFLAG(USE_ZYGOTE)
+    // The zygote sandboxes what it forks, so a renderer the embedder launches
+    // unsandboxed (--no-sandbox --no-zygote on its own command line) skips it.
+    std::unique_ptr<SandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate> sandbox_delegate =
+        std::make_unique<RendererSandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate>(
+            /*use_zygote=*/!cmd_line->HasSwitch(switches::kNoZygote));
 #else
     std::unique_ptr<SandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate> sandbox_delegate =
         std::make_unique<RendererSandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate>();
diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.cc
index e5e9bb9..ae1ca8e 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.cc
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.cc
@@ -35,6 +35,9 @@ namespace content {
 
 #if BUILDFLAG(USE_ZYGOTE)
 ZygoteCommunication* RendererSandboxedProcessLauncherDelegate::GetZygote() {
+  if (!use_zygote_) {
+    return nullptr;
+  }
   const base::CommandLine& browser_command_line =
       *base::CommandLine::ForCurrentProcess();
   base::CommandLine::StringType renderer_prefix =
diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.h b/content/browser/renderer_host/renderer_sandboxed_process_launcher_delegate.h
index e058db4..f70d526 100644
